_SdAc8d1b0VpW0PsaqC6w4fJczHK0DQgoC4OfoJ1y6Snqt69aOxij-8gwPk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGeMcrvvHA14mEfZVQ61R3iRP89UCy4ImzkdhaOH0obiA&oe=6A8AC5E1"}, {"file_name": "237453_0.png", "id": "1705348926613037", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974516_1705348929946370_1323409686179974529_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W17BCDOnOIUQ7kNvwFaAfFn&_nc_oc=AdqcoyS5oBaMvh0TjEn4AIWqdsserkmZ8RMH1uOyiR31FXmFWY9Se1H5Stzk12PVZhI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH6zAF_qSMo0M-YSiyUXSVuQNKUCcQufQQRP24M28lQyg&oe=6A8AD784"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "\u5c01\u9762\u5716\u50cf_2560_1440.png", "id": "1082116223133167", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75254869_1082116226466500_208783859597425828_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=60DuM6hLV-QQ7kNvwFIezu9&_nc_oc=AdpcpQZZ0O5HYPaM6tNGOkDMpNnppcBS8dWP0W9X41Ngr9vxnlcAf47fMWhotdbIQeE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGZpIdYGwwfGm8cKPR0-TQMV0HN2_vt9WXSU0AGiyyt5Q&oe=6A8ACB7C"}, "display_name": "The Guardians Ver.1", "keywords": [], "long_description": "The game \u201cGuardians\u201d is specifically designed for teenagers together having fun. The gaming scene is a fortress and you have to use the axes and magic to beat monsters with your VR controller. As a warrior guarding the fortress, the player must not retreat even a step when facing the attack of the monster army, and drive away all the monsters. In addition to throwing, you can also experience VR's close-range slashing when facing the endless attacks of monsters. Be more immersed in the feeling of charging into the enemy army.", "short_description": "The game \u201cGuardians\u201d is specifically designed for teenagers together having fun. The gaming scene is a fortress and you have to use the axes and magic to beat monsters with your VR controller. "}]}, "developer_na